 ## Background
-The method originates from implementations of voxel-based rendering and meshing, specifically in the context of dual contouring and octree simplification [S1, unofficial]. It is used in tools that convert 3D models to voxel representations and then export them as meshes [S3, unofficial]. The specific traversal logic is found in open-source voxelizer projects [S2, unofficial].
